  id: DOC_2009_BienBan
  title: "Bi\xEAn b\u1EA3n ni\xEAm phong"
  titleEn: Police Seal Notice
  year: 5
  body: "S\u1EDE C\u1EA2NH S\xC1T H\u1EA0T ASHFORD \u2014 BI\xCAN B\u1EA2N NI\xCAM
    PHONG.\nS\xE1u c\xF4ng nh\xE2n \u0111\u1ED9i c\u1EA3i t\u1EA1o m\u1EA5t t\xEDch
    sau khi khoan xuy\xEAn v\xE1ch t\u1EA7ng h\u1EA7m. Hi\u1EC7n tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
    ni\xEAm phong v\u0129nh vi\u1EC5n. C\u1EA5m m\u1ECDi h\xE0nh vi x\xE2m nh\u1EADp."
  bodyEn: "ASHFORD COUNTY POLICE \u2014 NOTICE OF SEAL.\nSix members of a renovation
    crew went missing after drilling through a cellar wall. The premises are sealed
    permanently. Trespassers will be prosecuted."
  serif: 1
  flagOnRead: 0
